  "ami": "scripts/qa/diarization_score.py (ADR 0058): zero collar, overlap included, UEM union, optimal one-to-one mapping; pyannote AMI-diarization-setup only_words RTTM and UEM; pooled figures weight recordings by reference speaker-seconds",
